### Register a test aircraft
POST http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json

{"icao24": "3c6444", "callsign": "DLH9LF", "registration": "D-AIBD", "model": "A319", "originCountry": "Germany"}

### Get one aircraft
GET http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft/3c6444

### List aircraft by country
GET http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft?country=Germany

### Unknown aircraft, expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft/abcdef

### Invalid ICAO24, expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json

{"icao24": "zz"}

### Register an aircraft currently flying (pick one from OpenSky)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json

{"icao24": "39de4d", "callsign": "TVF64BH", "originCountry": "France"}

### Live position from OpenSky, expect 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft/39de4d/position

### Live position of an unknown aircraft, expect 404 without calling OpenSky
GET http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft/abcdef/position